es COLD ROOM repair cost in Vadodara? <i class=\"fas\"></i> </button>\r\n<div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-gray-600\">\r\n<p>Our basic inspection charge is ₹500. The final cost for <strong>cold room repair in Vadodara</strong> depends on the specific issue and parts required. We always provide a transparent, detailed quote before starting any work, ensuring no hidden costs.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg\"><button class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left text-lg font-semibold p-6\"> How quickly can you send a technician for cold room repair? <i class=\"fas\"></i> </button>\r\n<div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-gray-600\">\r\n<p>We offer <strong>same-day emergency cold room service</strong> across most of Vadodara for calls received before 2 PM. Our goal is to minimize your downtime and get your operations back to normal as fast as possible.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg\"><button class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left text-lg font-semibold p-6\"> Do you repair all COLD ROOM brands and types? <i class=\"fas\"></i> </button>\r\n<div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-gray-600\">\r\n<p>Yes, our expert technicians are trained to repair all major cold room brands including Blue Star, Carrier, Daikin, Voltas, and more. We service all types, from <strong>walk-in chillers</strong> and <strong>freezers</strong> to complex <strong>pharmaceutical cold rooms</strong>.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg\"><button class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left text-lg font-semibold p-6\"> Do you offer a warranty on your repairs? <i class=\"fas\"></i> </button>\r\n<div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-gray-600\">\r\n<p>Absolutely. We provide a <strong>30-day service guarantee</strong> on all our repair services and a <strong>3-month warranty on spare parts</strong> to give you complete peace of mind.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg\"><button class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left text-lg font-semibold p-6\"> What should I do if my cold room is leaking water? <i class=\"fas\"></i> </button>\r\n<div class=\"p-6 pt-0 text-gray-600\">\r\n<p>If your <strong>cold room is leaking water</strong>, it could be due to a clogged drain line, a faulty door seal, or incorrect defrost cycles. It&#8217;s best to call a professional technician immediately to prevent product damage and safety hazards. We can diagnose and resolve the issue quickly.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Contact Section -->\r\n<section id=\"contact\" class=\"py-20 bg-gray-900 text-white\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl section-title\" style=\"color: white; --after-bg: #FFD700;\">Get a Free Quote Today!</h2>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Ready to get your cold room fixed? Contact us now for fast, professional service. We&#8217;re available 24/7 for <strong>emergency cold room repair in Vadodara</strong>.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-lg\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-yellow-400\">Book Your Service</h3>\r\n<form action=\"#\" method=\"POST\">\r\n<div class=\"mb-4\"><label class=\"block mb-2 font-semibold\" for=\"name\">Name</label> <input id=\"name\" class=\"w-full p-3 rounded bg-gray-700 border border-gray-600 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-yellow-500\" name=\"name\" required=\"\" type=\"text\" /></div>\r\n<div class=\"mb-4\"><label class=\"block mb-2 font-semibold\" for=\"phone\">Phone Number</label> <input id=\"phone\" class=\"w-full p-3 rounded bg-gray-700 border border-gray-600 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-yellow-500\" name=\"phone\" required=\"\" type=\"tel\" /></div>\r\n<div class=\"mb-6\"><label class=\"block mb-2 font-semibold\" for=\"service\">Se